openpci-rtl8029.device
======================

SANA-II network driver for RTL8029 (NE2000 compatible) PCI Ethernet cards
on classic AmigaOS (m68k), using openpci.library.

Double-click Install to install the driver; openpci-rtl8029.guide
documents the driver, client and s2stat.

Requirements

  AmigaOS 3.0 or later, openpci.library from the openpci package (Aminet
  driver/other/openpci68k.lha) and a SANA-II TCP/IP stack such as Roadshow.

